# Wave H.i.b — Neutralize Urban owner settings URL path

## Problem

After H.i the panel SoT lives in the Urban package, but the **public URL and app folder** remained product-named (`/settings/urban`, `app/(app)/settings/urban/`). Hostile audit item #7/#8 still cites that path as product-specific shell surface. Phase 8 canLoad **policy** stays Urban-specific; only the shell URL/folder should be product-blind.

## Decision

| Concern | Value |
| ------- | ----- |
| Canonical URL | `/settings/workspace-owner` |
| App module | `apps/web/app/(app)/settings/workspace-owner/` |
| canLoad re-export file | `workspace-owner-settings-access.ts` (Wave H.m; was `urban-settings-access.ts`) |
| Manifest nav | `operatorShell.phase3NavLinks[].href` → `/settings/workspace-owner` |
| i18n labelKey | `workspaceOwnerSettings` (replace `urbanSettings` in nav) |
| Legacy URL | permanent redirect `/settings/urban` → `/settings/workspace-owner` |

Update Phase 8 **normative** path constants in `CANLOAD-URBAN-SETTINGS.contract.ts`:

- `URBAN_SETTINGS_PAGE_PATH`
- `URBAN_SETTINGS_PAGE_MODULE`
- `URBAN_SETTINGS_ACCESS_MODULE`

Export `URBAN_SETTINGS_PAGE_PATH_LEGACY = "/settings/urban"` for redirect/docs.

Regenerate operator shell nav bindings via `pnpm run generate:workspace-registry`.

## Out of scope

- Renaming canLoad symbols (`canLoadUrbanSettings`, plugin id `urban`) — still Urban product policy
- Changing API `/urban/settings`
- Install-graph isolation
- Rewriting every historical Phase 8 narrative doc (route matrix web rows + agent router + guards updated; older smoke maps may still mention legacy URL as redirected)
- ~~Shell file/page/panel/i18n Urban names~~ → **done in** [`wave-h-workspace-owner-shell-typing.mdoc`](./wave-h-workspace-owner-shell-typing.mdoc) (Wave H.m)

## Verify

```bash
test -d apps/web/app/(app)/settings/workspace-owner
test ! -d apps/web/app/(app)/settings/urban
pnpm run generate:workspace-registry
pnpm --filter @apps/web exec node --import tsx --test \
  test/urban-owner-access.spec.ts \
  test/operator-shell-nav.spec.ts \
  test/wave-h-urban-settings-path.spec.ts \
  test/wave-h-urban-settings-colocation.spec.ts \
  test/workspace-boundary.spec.ts
```
